STRING 39999
{
Note: The AI messages in this version were translated into Chinese by Ciel; most of the other DotA in-game strings come largely from the official DotA translation team, with some contributed by Weiran Xiaochaoren of the Baidu dotaai forum.
I will gradually move all AI message strings and panel text out of the script and into the end of itemstrings.txt, so that other translators can work on them and language versions can stay in sync. See that file for details.
}
STRING 49998
{
During mode selection, adjust how much gold/exp the AI earns. Gold and exp adjustments can be combined.

Experience:
|c00dd8dffDefault:|r +20%/45%/80% by difficulty.
|c00dd8dff-normexp (-ne):|r no bonus exp.
|c00dd8dff-highexp (-he):|r larger bonus, +40%/70%/110% by difficulty.
|c00dd8dff-dynaexp (-de):|r dynamic. On each AI death, +(50+5*opposing lane players)%. +17.5% per 3 min with no AI kill. -33%/25% on AI kill/assist. Caps at +200%.

Gold:
|c00dd8dffDefault:|r 0/4/8 per 7s by difficulty, plus a small starting bonus.
|c00dd8dff-normgold (-ng):|r no bonus gold.
|c00dd8dff-highgold (-hg):|r +8 per 7s, +10% starting gold.
|c00dd8dff-dynagold (-dg):|r dynamic. On each AI death, +5 per 7s. +2.5 per 7s each 3 min with no AI kill (from min 5). -33%/25% on AI kill/assist. Caps at 72 per 7s.

Combos:
|c00dd8dff-beginnermode (-bm):|r normexp + normgold.
|c00dd8dff-advancedmode (-am):|r + dynaexp + dynagold.
|c00dd8dff-xtrememode (-xm):|r same as advanced, higher dynamic bonus.
}
STRING 49999
{
The AI script for this map was created mainly by Cloud_str, RGB and BuffMePlz. I (PBMN) and the PlayDotA.com AI team have worked to improve the AI so it keeps up with the constantly updated DotA map, but most of the core work was done by the original authors.

For AI map updates and development progress, see http://dota-pbmn.blogspot.com/

The map's AI system was made jointly by PleaseBugMeNot (PBMN), Cloud_str, Ciel & the AITeam.
}
